            %p
              The condition
              %a.maruku-eqref{:href => "#eq:NaturalitySquareForAdjointnessOfFunctors"} (11)
              says equivalently that
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
