                    %mi 𝒟
                    %mo →
                    %mi 𝒞
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} L \colon \mathcal{D} \to \mathcal{C}
              is given, and we are asking for uniqueness of its right adjoint, if it exists. The other case is directly analogous.
            %p
              Suppose that
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msub
                      %mi R
